From 0e509eb44b1ea87bbf84de90c9265a4e5c96e4fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omkar Anand Kulkarni <omkar.kulkarni@arm.com>
Date: Sat, 13 Apr 2024 15:10:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(rdfremont): add base ram error injection support

Add support to perform error injection on base ram. Implementation
added that programs AP secure ram ecc registers to inject 1-bit CE into
the non-secure base element ram.

This patch helps validate the firmware-first error handing support
implemented for base element rams.

Signed-off-by: Omkar Anand Kulkarni <omkar.kulkarni@arm.com>
Change-Id: Ib57e8afa7b037b6e603feb251dd28d4574d4ece0

Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 .../common/include/nrd3/nrd_plat_arm_def3.h   |  5 ++
 .../platform/rdv3/einj/nrd_einj_sram.c        | 55 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../neoverse_rd/platform/rdv3/platform.mk     |  5 ++
 3 files changed, 65 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 plat/arm/board/neoverse_rd/platform/rdv3/einj/nrd_einj_sram.c

